        <mxCell id="why" value="前两步治「断」，后两步治「刺」，最后一步治「拖」" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
